    "instructions": "1. Combine the mezcal, sweet vermouth, Cynar, Aperol, optional agave syrup, and mole bitters in a mixing glass with ice.\n2. Stir until chilled.\n3. Strain into an old fashioned glass filled with ice.\n4. Garnish with a grapefruit twist.",
